  "rationale": "Blocking configSecret:credentialAccess and ssoLogin:authenticate makes the target unreachable. Without configSecret, dbLogin (an AND step) fails, so jumpHost, vaultRead and codeRepo fail through that route. monitoringHost loses all three parents (configSecret, ssoLogin, dbLogin), so codeRepo, localAdmin, serviceAccount and dbReplica fail. Without ssoLogin, secretsManager (an AND step) fails, so shareMount fails. One block is not enough. The shareMount route (secretsManager needing vpnSession and ssoLogin) and the monitoringHost route (via configSecret, which comes from the vpnGateway foothold) share no blockable step."
